  "visualInspection": [
    "Inspected16 study+16 game actual textured GLB headings at224 native/fixed density, plus fixed-crop nearest detail sheets. Recognizable chopped closed cab, short rounded tail, broad-block exposed gray V8, narrow front chassis, small skinny front wheels, oversized rear tires, fixed side pipes and restrained orange flame shapes on plum skin. No logos/tiny text/PBR appearance.",
    "Cab side cool-blue glass uses continuous dark framed own skin chart; windshield/rear glass half-charts and roof have separate semantic owners. Orange flame polygons are atlas paint on actual side skin, not screen overlays or geometry clutter. Engine reads as broad crankcase/valve-bank/intake/air-cleaner blocks.",
    "Intentionally open front wheels remain exposed/outboard, visibly next to engine/front chassis in both complete camera sets, never assigned to cab roof. Actual exported attachment arms stop0.260872world units short of each front tire slab, below one logical pixel. Native line/hub attachment looks seated rather than floating.",
    "Rear tires are under broad integrated plum fenders with real open outer arches and closed inboard wheelhouse cheeks. Tightened wheel-local rear pockets leave a clean body join. No visible rear wheel crowns on cab/trunk roof or above real rear fenders; temporary32-view wheel-ID colors independently distinguish tires from plum inner-panel crease/shadow lines.",
    "Coverage is explicitly per axle: shared raw front0/25each and declaredExpectationMet=false retained unchanged; frontN/A/intentionally-open by owner instruction, no all-four covered metric claimed. Rear25/25each meets own finite fat-tire region; positive/negative ray controls pass. All-four neutral-roll fixed-triangle nonintersection, collision negative and reset separately pass.",
    "Inspected8 ordinary shared-distance phases/camera,8 additional equal-angle phases/camera using each wheel own radius, both wireframes and per-wheel neutral/quarter/reverse/reset visuals. Front radius.32/rear.55 each match own exported geometry; all other wheels/static engine/exhaust/body stay fixed; reset pixels identical.",
    "Packed master63 semantic meshes/low5,2 packed images and one UV layer audited. Actual bounds4.2x2.4x1.6source; no camera fitting/rescale/recenter. No blocking visual findings. Minor native aliasing of skinny front hubs/chrome headers and plum wheelhouse join lines remains.",
    "Neutral steering only; no steering/suspension/exhaust/equipment/new physics qualification. Honest front exception remains explicit in portable raw evidence, assessment and final report."
  ],
